## Goal
Visualize how the six samples cluster in principal component space based on gene expression profiles, with samples colored by treatment condition (untreated vs treated). This reveals whether gene expression differences between conditions are the dominant source of variation, and whether replicates group as expected.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

| Artifact type | Resolved from | Path |
